 # 12\. API Design

 The backend can expose REST API endpoints such as:

 | Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| POST | `/api/register` | Register user |
| POST | `/api/login` | Authenticate user |
| POST | `/api/chat` | Send question to Gemini |
| POST | `/api/summarize` | Summarize study material |
| POST | `/api/quiz` | Generate quiz |
| POST | `/api/evaluate` | Evaluate answers |
| GET | `/api/history` | Retrieve chat history |
| GET | `/api/progress` | Retrieve progress |
| POST | `/api/logout` | End session |

The exact endpoints can vary depending on the chosen backend framework.

