 # 13\. Security Design

 Security is an important part of the system architecture.

 The design should include:

 - Secure authentication.
- Password hashing where passwords are managed directly.
- Input validation.
- Authorization checks.
- Protected database access.
- HTTPS in production.
- Server-side storage of the Gemini API key.
- Protection against unauthorized API requests.

 The frontend should **never contain the Gemini API key**.

