 ## Conclusion

 The design of **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** provides a structured architecture for implementing an AI-powered educational platform. The separation of the presentation, application, database, and AI layers makes the system easier to develop, test, maintain, and extend. The design also provides a foundation for future features such as voice interaction, multilingual learning, document-based tutoring, adaptive quizzes, and mobile applications.
